# pca: PURE light HOL4. NO CakeML / candle / hol-reflection.
#
# Proof-carrying actions: the untrusted controller emits (action,
# certificate); a checkable certifier (an explicit predicate parameter,
# NOT an oracle) gates execution; the trusted verified sub-policy shield
# acts otherwise. Generalises the FIXED-policy envelope of envelopeTheory.
#
# Only `..` is needed: the generic policy-parametric core
# (systemTheory / envelopeTheory / safetyTheory / sv_weakeningTheory /
# upgradeTheory) is pure HOL4 with no CakeML dependency. This layer
# REUSES that core (esp. safetyTheory.safety_preservation and
# upgradeTheory.self_improvement_is_safe) and does not edit it.
INCLUDES = ..
OPTIONS = QUIT_ON_FAILURE
